Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.52,Short,,0,0,0,,That voice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:01.30,Short,,0,0,0,,on the recording
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:02.50,Short,,0,0,0,,really is you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:03.40,Short,,0,0,0,,When you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:04.24,Short,,0,0,0,,you hear yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:05.16,Short,,0,0,0,,two ways
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:06.76,Short,,0,0,0,,Sound leaves your mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:07.40,Short,,0,0,0,,and travels
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:08.16,Short,,0,0,0,,through the air
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:08.96,Short,,0,0,0,,into your ears
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:09.80,Short,,0,0,0,,the same way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:11.30,Short,,0,0,0,,everyone else hears it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.38,Short,,0,0,0,,But it also travels
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.12,Short,,0,0,0,,straight through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:14.36,Short,,0,0,0,,the bones of your skull
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:15.30,Short,,0,0,0,,and that path
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:16.66,Short,,0,0,0,,makes your voice sound
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:17.78,Short,,0,0,0,,deeper and fuller
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:18.66,Short,,0,0,0,,A recording
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:19.48,Short,,0,0,0,,only catches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:20.76,Short,,0,0,0,,the sound in the air
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.76,0:00:21.67,Short,,0,0,0,,so it sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:22.52,Short,,0,0,0,,thinner and higher
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:23.28,Short,,0,0,0,,than the voice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.12,Short,,0,0,0,,in your head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:25.44,Short,,0,0,0,,The good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:26.50,Short,,0,0,0,,In one study
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:27.10,Short,,0,0,0,,people rated
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:28.52,Short,,0,0,0,,their own recorded voice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:29.50,Short,,0,0,0,,as more attractive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:30.26,Short,,0,0,0,,as long as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:31.87,Short,,0,0,0,,they didn't recognize it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:32.50,Short,,0,0,0,,So next time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:33.28,Short,,0,0,0,,you hear yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.04,Short,,0,0,0,,on a video
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:34.76,Short,,0,0,0,,don't cringe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:35.07,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.30,0:00:31.60,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwho hates their voice on video
